Subject: SSR Plus: backport Xray SS credentials and decode transport queries once

Backport fw876/helloworld 16617bee81157f68965994125b88ee74a822faa5
credentials handling to the reviewed master baseline. Master keeps its own
host validation; dev's normalize_host helper and package version are not imported.
Reject empty userinfo as well as malformed whole-link credentials before the
existing complete subscription group validation and transaction boundary.

SS and VLESS URL.query values are decoded by lua-neturl. Trojan's manual
query parser also decodes values once. Consume host/path/Reality values
directly, preserving encoded percent and plus characters; retain the existing
TLS/WebSocket Host conditions and already-correct extra JSON/gRPC/TLS fields.

